How many artifacts are in the game? If two or less there are
some neat things you could wish for that you can't get
otherwise. A chaotic wizard might wish for The master Key of
Thievery for 1/2 physical damage, warning and teleport
control (your wizard gets that at XL 17 anyway). A neutral
wizard might try The Staff of Aesculapius for x2 damage to
all non-level-drain-resistant monsters, hungerless
regeneration and protection from level drain. Invoked it
heals half hp loss, cures sickness, unblinds and unslimes.
Both will zap you for a bit of damage every time you pick
them up or use them.

I would definitely get a [HoB and some magic markers as
needed. If you aren't polypiling, you might wish for a tee
shirt if you haven't found one after Gehennom. You can get a
+FoD by praying.

